{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just Build is a city builder game about building your town from scratch while completing certain objectives within a given time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/extras/gif1.1.gif?t=1748437704\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first 2 levels of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just Build focuses on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In just Build, you have a set of objectives which you have to complete within a particular amount of time like for example, having a population  of over 200 before 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/extras/gif2.1.gif?t=1748437704\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource Management:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Just Build, Resource management is very important because completing the objectives depend solely on how you managed your resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/extras/gif3.gif?t=1748437704\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356530?t=1748437704","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356530?t=1748437704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/d638e22218077235e6c7f2b60e9ed236389e42d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748437704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/d638e22218077235e6c7f2b60e9ed236389e42d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748437704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just Build is a city builder game about building your town from scratch while completing certain objectives within a given time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/extras/gif1.1.gif?t=1748437704\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first 2 levels of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just Build focuses on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In just Build, you have a set of objectives which you have to complete within a particular amount of time like for example, having a population  of over 200 before 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/extras/gif2.1.gif?t=1748437704\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource Management:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Just Build, Resource management is very important because completing the objectives depend solely on how you managed your resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356530/extras/gif3.gif?t=1748437704\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","develope